# the receiver `table` (book §10; REVIEW e682d71, M48): unit_s7_prim_cross over its own convert.lm2 whose
# table gives all four arguments by position -- `source`, the name, the columns and the one row it needs,
# each a Structure (tests/unit_s7_tbl_positional_table.lm2): bound as the named form is, Entry 7.

fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

int: k
k: go()
if: k = 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 1; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
